Usage: 1z fmt [options] <file...>
       1z fmt [--check] .

Format 1z source files in place.

Fmt options:
  --check                   Report files needing formatting; exit 1 if any do
  --stdout                  Write formatted output to stdout instead of in place

Global options:
  --max-memory=SIZE         Set memory limit (e.g. 128M, 1G; default 256M)
  --load-path=PATH          Add a module search path (repeatable)
  --stdlib-path=PATH        Override standard library path
  --prelude=PATH            Override prelude file path
